{"seq":3,"slug":"scheduler-controller-pressure","title":"调度器、控制器与 informer 积压","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-at-scale-performance/control-plane-scale/scheduler-controller-pressure","wordCount":2100,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"调度器-控制器与-informer-积压\">调度器、控制器与 informer 积压</h1><p>apiserver 与 etcd 的指标都在正常范围，但集群的「状态收敛」明显变慢：Deployment 改了副本数要几分钟才全部起来，Pod 删除了但对应的 Endpoint 迟迟不从 Service 里摘掉，节点上的 Pod 数明明还有余量却没人被调度上去。这类症状的根源不在控制面的存储层，而在两个长期运行的组件：<strong>kube-scheduler</strong> 与各种 <strong>controller</strong>。它们的吞吐不是由 CPU 决定的，而是由「处理一个对象的成本 × 队列长度 × 重试率」这三项共同决定。本篇拆解这三项的机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先区分两个角色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>kube-scheduler</strong>：把 <code>Pending</code> 的 Pod 绑定到节点。它是一个「过滤器 + 打分」流水线，唯一职责是产出 <code>Binding</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>controller</strong>：<code>kube-controller-manager</code> 里的内置控制器（Deployment、ReplicaSet、EndpointSlice、Node、Job 等）加上所有 Operator，它们读期望状态、读实际状态、写实际状态，循环收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者共享同一套基础设施：<strong>client-go 的 informer</strong>（本地缓存 + watch）与 <strong>workqueue</strong>（去重队列 + 指数退避重试）。理解这两个组件是理解所有「控制器变慢」问题的前提。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[apiserver watch 流] --&gt; B[Reflector 接收事件]&#10;    B --&gt; C[DeltaFIFO 队列]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Indexer 本地缓存更新]&#10;    C --&gt; E[EventHandler 入队 key 到 workqueue]&#10;    E --&gt; F{workqueue}&#10;    F --&gt;|同一 key 已在队| G[去重, 不重复入队]&#10;    F --&gt; H[worker 取出 key]&#10;    H --&gt; I[从 Indexer 读对象]&#10;    I --&gt; J[执行 reconcile]&#10;    J --&gt;|成功| K[Forget: 重置退避]&#10;    J --&gt;|失败| L[AddRateLimited: 指数退避重入队]&#10;    L --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n    A[apiserver watch 流] --&gt; B[Reflector 接收事件]\n    B --&gt; C[DeltaFIFO 队列]\n    C --&gt; D[Indexer 本地缓存更新]\n    C --&gt; E[EventHandler 入队 key 到 workqueue]\n    E --&gt; F{workqueue}\n    F --&gt;|同一 key 已在队| G[去重, 不重复入队]\n    F --&gt; H[worker 取出 key]\n    H --&gt; I[从 Indexer 读对象]\n    I --&gt; J[执行 reconcile]\n    J --&gt;|成功| K[Forget: 重置退避]\n    J --&gt;|失败| L[AddRateLimited: 指数退避重入队]\n    L --&gt; F</pre><p>三个关键量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>规模化失配表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>informer 缓存延迟</strong></td>\n<td>watch 事件到达与 Indexer 更新之间的时间</td>\n<td>控制器读到陈旧状态，做出错误决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>workqueue depth</strong></td>\n<td>待处理 key 数</td>\n<td>持续增长 = 处理速度 &lt; 变更速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>重试率</strong></td>\n<td><code>AddRateLimited</code> 调用比例</td>\n<td>退避放大延迟，队列被无效任务占满</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>调度吞吐</strong></td>\n<td>每秒成功绑定的 Pod 数</td>\n<td>低于 Pod 创建速率则 Pending 累积</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"调度器的吞吐模型与常见瓶颈\">调度器的吞吐模型与常见瓶颈</h2><p>kube-scheduler 的核心是一个串行流水线：调度队列（<code>activeQ</code> / <code>backoffQ</code> / <code>unschedulableQ</code>）→ 调度周期（<code>SchedulePod</code>）→ 绑定（向 apiserver 写 <code>Binding</code>）。单次调度周期的成本大致是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{schedule} \\approx T_{filter} \\cdot N_{nodes} + T_{score} \\cdot N_{feasible} + T_{plugin\\ overhead}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ug</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{nodes}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是节点数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{feasible}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是通过过滤的节点数。这解释了为什么调度吞吐会随集群规模下降：<strong>过滤阶段要遍历所有节点</strong>，即使 99% 的节点在第一个谓词就被排除。</p>\n<p>实践中拖慢调度器的四个因素：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，大量不可调度的 Pod 堆积。</strong> 一个 <code>Pending</code> 的 Pod 如果因为资源不足调度失败，会被移到 <code>unschedulableQ</code>，每当集群有节点或 Pod 变化（<code>Node</code> 更新、<code>Pod</code> 增删）就会触发「把 unschedulableQ 里的 Pod 重新放回 activeQ」的评估。数万个不可调度 Pod 会让每次集群变化都引爆一轮全量重试。这是 <code>Pending</code> Pod 雪崩的机制。缓解手段是控制不合理的大资源请求 Pod 的数量，以及用 <code>PriorityClass</code> + <code>preemption</code> 让高优先级 Pod 能抢占（抢占会立刻触发驱逐与重试，要注意它本身也会放大队列压力）。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，调度插件的自定义成本。</strong> 每个启用的 plugin（尤其是 webhook 型的 <code>SchedulerFramework</code> 扩展）都会在过滤或打分阶段被同步调用。一个 5ms 的自定义 filter plugin 乘以 5000 节点就是 25 秒的单 Pod 调度延迟。<strong>任何调度扩展都必须做到缓存命中且无网络调用。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第三，打分阶段的 <code>NodeResourcesBalancedAllocation</code>、<code>NodeResourcesFit</code> 与 <code>InterPodAffinity</code>。</strong> 尤其是 <code>InterPodAffinity</code>：它需要遍历节点上所有 Pod 的亲和性标签来构造打分，复杂度与节点上的 Pod 数相关。在大集群里，亲和性规则的写法（<code>preferredDuringSchedulingIgnoredDuringExecution</code> 的 <code>weight</code> 与 <code>topologyKey</code>）比开启与否更影响性能。</p>\n<p><strong>第四，<code>PercentageOfNodesToScore</code>。</strong> 这是调度器的一个关键参数，默认由集群规模自动推导（从 100% 逐步降到 5%）。它控制了打分阶段只采样多少比例的节点，是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N_{nodes})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的官方手段。但如果采样比例过低，会导致「有合适的节点但没被采到」的调度质量下降，表现为 Pod 分布不均。</p>\n<p>值得注意的趋势是 <strong>workload-aware scheduling</strong> 在 1.36–1.37 期间的推进：调度器开始支持按 workload 特性（如 Gang scheduling、<code>Workload</code> 对象的拓扑约束）做放置决策。这类功能会引入额外的插件计算，启用前应当用 <code>scheduler_scheduling_attempt_duration_seconds</code> 与 <code>scheduler_pod_scheduling_sli_duration_seconds</code> 建立基线再评估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"控制器-workqueue-重试率才是真正的杀手\">控制器：workqueue 重试率才是真正的杀手</h2><p>控制器的吞吐模型与调度器不同。它有 N 个 worker 并行处理 workqueue 中的 key，处理一个 key 需要从 Indexer 读对象、做计算、写回 apiserver。因此：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{ctrl} \\approx \\frac{N_{workers}}{\\overline{T}_{process}}, \\qquad \\overline{T}_{process} = T_{read}^{cache} + T_{compute} + T_{write}^{apiserver}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4198em;vertical-align:-1.0594em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2267em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ocess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0594em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ocess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2194em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9426em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>T_write</code> 是大集群里最容易失控的一项，因为它包含 apiserver 的排队与 etcd 的 fsync。<strong>当控制面写延迟上升时，控制器变慢，于是它重试更多，制造更多写请求，进一步推高写延迟——这是一个正反馈。</strong> 这就是为什么 etcd 一慢，整个集群的状态收敛会雪崩式变慢，而不只是等比例变慢。</p>\n<p>判断控制器是否健康的核心指标是 workqueue 的四个计数器：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>危险信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>workqueue_depth</code></td>\n<td>当前队列长度</td>\n<td>持续增长或高位不降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workqueue_adds_total</code></td>\n<td>累计入队次数</td>\n<td>增速远大于对象变更速率 → 有 controller 在自激</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workqueue_retries_total</code></td>\n<td>累计重试次数</td>\n<td>重试/入队比例 &gt; 10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workqueue_queue_duration_seconds</code></td>\n<td>从入队到被处理的等待</td>\n<td>p99 超过业务容忍的收敛时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个具体的诊断方法：<code>rate(workqueue_adds_total) - rate(workqueue_retries_total)</code> 应当近似等于实际的资源变更速率。如果 <code>adds</code> 是变更速率的 10 倍，说明有 controller 在做「读 → 写 → 触发自己 watch → 再读」的自激循环。</p>\n<p>常见的自激来源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>status 更新与自己 watch 的资源重叠</strong>。给 <code>Pod</code> 加 finalizer 的 controller 会 watch <code>Pod</code>，然后每次 reconcile 都写一次 <code>status</code>（即使无变化），写触发新事件，再入队。正确做法是对比后再写（<code>if !reflect.DeepEqual(old, new)</code>），或用 <code>Patch</code> 只写变化字段。</li>\n<li><strong><code>resyncPeriod</code> 设得过短</strong>。client-go 的 resync 会周期性把所有对象重新入队以「提醒」controller 检查是否漂移。5 分钟的默认值在中小集群没问题，但在数万对象 + 数百个实例的集群里，一次 resync 就是数万次入队。<strong>大集群的 resyncPeriod 应当按对象规模调大（如 30–60 分钟）或对稳定资源关闭。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>多个 controller 写同一个对象的同一字段</strong>。典型的冲突是多个 operator 都想给 <code>Node</code> 加 label，导致 <code>409 Conflict</code> 重试。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 反例：每次都写 status，制造无意义事件&#10;func (c *Controller) reconcile(ctx context.Context, key string) error {&#10;    obj := c.get(key)&#10;    obj.Status.ObservedGeneration = obj.Generation&#10;    return c.client.Status().Update(ctx, obj) // 生成新 resourceVersion&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 正例：比较后再写，且只 patch 变化字段&#10;func (c *Controller) reconcile(ctx context.Context, key string) error {&#10;    obj := c.get(key)&#10;    if obj.Status.ObservedGeneration == obj.Generation {&#10;        return nil // 无变化，不产生写&#10;    }&#10;    patch := client.MergeFrom(obj.DeepCopy())&#10;    obj.Status.ObservedGeneration = obj.Generation&#10;    return c.client.Status().Patch(ctx, obj, patch)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 反例：每次都写 status，制造无意义事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Controller</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reconcile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    obj </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    obj.Status.ObservedGeneration </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obj.Generation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, obj) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 生成新 resourceVersion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正例：比较后再写，且只 patch 变化字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Controller</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reconcile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    obj </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obj.Status.ObservedGeneration </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obj.Generation {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 无变化，不产生写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    patch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MergeFrom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(obj.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DeepCopy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    obj.Status.ObservedGeneration </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obj.Generation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Patch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, obj, patch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"informer-积压的识别与治理\">informer 积压的识别与治理</h2><p>informer 积压是最难察觉的一类问题，因为它的症状不是报错而是「慢」和「不一致」。Reflector 从 watch 流读到事件后要经过 DeltaFIFO，再由 <code>HandleDeltas</code> 分发给 Indexer 与 EventHandler。<strong>如果 EventHandler 是同步且慢的，反压会传导回 DeltaFIFO 与 watch 流</strong>，直接表现为 <code>watch</code> 连接被 apiserver 断开（<code>apiserver_longrunning_requests</code> 与 <code>apiserver_watch_events_sizes</code> 可观测），然后 Reflector 重连并可能触发 <code>410 Gone</code> 走全量 relist。</p>\n<p>排查路径：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>看 client-go 的 <code>reflector_*</code> 与 <code>workqueue_*</code> 指标（或 controller-runtime 的 <code>controller_runtime_reconcile_total{result=&quot;error&quot;}</code>）。</li>\n<li>看 apiserver 侧 <code>apiserver_watch_events_sizes</code> 与 <code>apiserver_longrunning_gauge</code>，确认 watch 数量与事件量级。</li>\n<li>确认 EventHandler 中是否有同步的阻塞操作（写 etcd、调用外部 API、持有锁）。</li>\n<li>确认是否有 informer 意外缓存了超大对象（<code>WithTransform</code> 缺失），导致每次 DeltaFIFO 处理都要深拷贝大对象。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>治理手段的优先级：<strong>先让 EventHandler 只做「入队」</strong>（把计算放进 workqueue 的 worker），这是 client-go 设计的本意，但很多自研代码在 EventHandler 里直接做 reconcile；<strong>再减少 watch 的资源类型与字段</strong>（<code>metadata-only</code> informer）；<strong>最后才考虑加 worker 数</strong>——加 worker 只对 CPU 或 IO 受限有效，对「写 apiserver 慢」无效，且会加剧 apiserver 压力。</p>\n<p>控制器的信息源与容量上限在 apiserver 侧，那部分的开销结构见 <a href=\"apiserver-scalability\">apiserver：限流、watch 分页与请求开销</a>；当控制面写入被磁盘拖慢时控制器的正反馈机制，与 <a href=\"etcd-compaction\">etcd 规模化：压缩、去碎片化与磁盘延迟</a> 中讨论的 fsync 延迟直接相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调度器吞吐随节点数下降，因为过滤与打分要遍历节点；<code>PercentageOfNodesToScore</code> 是把它变为常数级的官方旋钮。</li>\n<li>大量 <code>Pending</code> Pod 会造成「集群一有变化就全量重试」的雪崩，这是调度队列最典型的过载模式。</li>\n<li>控制器的真正杀手是 <strong>重试率</strong>：写延迟上升 → 重试增多 → 写更多 → 更慢，这是正反馈回路。</li>\n<li><code>rate(workqueue_adds_total)</code> 与真实变更速率的比值是判断自激循环最直接的指标。</li>\n<li>治理 informer 积压的顺序是：让 EventHandler 只入队 → 缩小 watch 范围 → 最后才加 worker。</li>\n<li>大集群必须调大或关闭 <code>resyncPeriod</code>，周期性全量 resync 是稳定的低价值负载。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"调度器、控制器与 informer 积压","id":"调度器-控制器与-informer-积压"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"调度器的吞吐模型与常见瓶颈","id":"调度器的吞吐模型与常见瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"控制器：workqueue 重试率才是真正的杀手","id":"控制器-workqueue-重试率才是真正的杀手"},{"level":2,"text":"informer 积压的识别与治理","id":"informer-积压的识别与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"etcd 规模化：压缩、去碎片化与磁盘延迟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-at-scale-performance/control-plane-scale/etcd-compaction"},"next":{"title":"kube-proxy：iptables 与 IPVS 的规模分水岭","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-at-scale-performance/networking-at-scale/kube-proxy-ipvs"}}